SOAPBOX: ran fairly smoothly, with most participants up to speed on the
SOAPBOX: rules and settings. The solar storm gave us bad conditions on 60
SOAPBOX: deg N. Only worked a handful of DX stations, while 100 W and a
SOAPBOX: resonant wire antenna should reach around the globe. Will be back
SOAPBOX: next year.
